        "transliteration": "Famaa lakum fil muna-fiqeena fi-ataini wallaahu arkasahum bimaa kasaboo; atureedoona an tahdoo man adallal laahu Wa-maien yudli-lil laahu falan tajida lahoo sabeelaa",
        "translation": "So, what is the matter with you that you have become two groups about the hypocrites, while Allah has reverted them because of what they did. Do you want to guide the one whom Allah has let go astray? The one whom Allah lets go astray, you shall never find a way for him.",
